WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:02.960
Unit five. My Feelings!

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.346
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.396 --> 00:00:10.678
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:14.117
Today we learn about My Feelings. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:18.610
Happy. Say it with me. Happy!

6
00:00:22.107 --> 00:00:25.557
Sad. Say it with me. Sad!

7
00:00:29.036 --> 00:00:32.436
Angry. Say it with me. Angry!

8
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:39.625
Scared. Say it with me. Scared!

9
00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:46.343
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

10
00:00:49.852 --> 00:00:53.202
Share. Say it with me. Share!

11
00:00:56.685 --> 00:00:59.735
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

12
00:01:03.239 --> 00:01:07.322
Understand. Say it with me. Understand!

13
00:01:10.829 --> 00:01:20.624
Sometimes I feel happy, and sometimes I feel sad or angry. It is okay to share my feelings with someone I trust. Talking helps others understand how I feel.

14
00:01:20.674 --> 00:01:21.924
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:28.055
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.105 --> 00:01:29.255
Angry!

17
00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:35.305
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.355 --> 00:01:36.500
Talk!

19
00:01:37.199 --> 00:01:43.491
Did you know? Naming your feelings, like saying 'I feel sad,' can actually help you feel calmer!

20
00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:45.520
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.326 --> 00:01:54.438
Think and answer. What do you do when you feel angry or upset?

22
00:01:54.488 --> 00:01:55.638
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.759 --> 00:02:01.693
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.743 --> 00:02:04.354
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

